    {
      "id": "39619106",
      "title": "How GitHub Copilot Works & Can Be Used",
      "sourceHash": "d1ea97b876b3121039c56c33c1cdf194f1dcdfd9adfdd16fe8e11a982cb3cb82",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.91,
          "en": "Now, it's in this app.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 7.91,
          "en": "where I have this Core Concepts section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.04,
          "end": 12.63,
          "en": "where I have an unordered list that seems to be empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "There are no items in that list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "and indeed, that's the reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 19.053,
          "en": "for why we're not seeing anything here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.79,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "Now, we could of course write all the code here on our own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 27.72,
          "en": "but we can also use GitHub Copilot for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 31.68,
          "en": "and the great thing about this GitHub Copilot extension",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.68,
          "end": 36.51,
          "en": "is that it automatically scans the code you are working on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.51,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "So, for example, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "it's probably scanning the code I have in this file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 44.97,
          "en": "and it uses this as context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.97,
          "end": 48.483,
          "en": "to generate smart suggestions for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.19,
          "end": 52.32,
          "en": "And to get those suggestions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.32,
          "end": 55.74,
          "en": "it's often enough to just tap into a new line,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.74,
          "end": 57.51,
          "en": "and as you see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.51,
          "end": 59.82,
          "en": "this gray text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.82,
          "end": 63.813,
          "en": "is now a suggestion generated by Copilot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "and you can now simply hit tap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 70.533,
          "en": "to accept and implement this suggestion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.858,
          "end": 75.333,
          "en": "Alternatively, you can also run a command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.21000000000001,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "and open the Copilot Completions Panel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "to see some suggestions on the right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 88.92,
          "en": "And the great thing about these suggestions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 91.47,
          "en": "is that they're also more complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 94.89,
          "en": "than the suggestions you're getting right in the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.89,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "because in the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 100.17,
          "en": "you often just get a single line completion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.17,
          "end": 102.78,
          "en": "and once you do that and jump to the next line,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.78,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "you get a suggestion for that line,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 107.25,
          "en": "and that can also be pretty efficient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.25,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "because you can simply go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 110.88,
          "en": "these suggestions line by line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.88,
          "end": 112.803,
          "en": "and quickly add some code like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 117.66,
          "en": "But alternatively, you can also open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 120.03,
          "en": "that Completions Menu I mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.03,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "and see the finished multi-line suggestion here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 127.44,
          "en": "and often, you also have multiple suggestions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "which you could use as alternatives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 131.91,
          "en": "and you can then simply take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.91,
          "end": 133.92,
          "en": "at these different suggestions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.92,
          "end": 136.82999999999998,
          "en": "and pick the one you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 140.13,
          "en": "Now here, I'll use that first suggestion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.13,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "and I can accept it and use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 146.64,
          "en": "by clicking on Accept Solution above that suggestion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 151.263,
          "en": "So, if I click here, you see this code was inserted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 154.98,
          "en": "And with that, if I save this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "this already looks a lot better here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "though clearly it looks like the images are missing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 163.98,
          "en": "and are not being displayed here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.98,
          "end": 167.673,
          "en": "and maybe GitHub Copilot can help us fix that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 172.35,
          "en": "For that, we can visit this CoreConcept component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.35,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "which in the end is being output here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 178.07999999999998,
          "en": "so that we also give Copilot a glimpse",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.07999999999998,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "at the code inside of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 184.593,
          "en": "so that it sees how that code here works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.46,
          "end": 188.19,
          "en": "And with that, if I go back to my code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.19,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "it now indeed might suggest to add this image prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 194.37,
          "en": "to this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.37,
          "end": 198.18,
          "en": "so to this custom HTML element, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.18,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "And if I hit tap here and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 204.213,
          "en": "I therefore now get these images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.74,
          "end": 207.66,
          "en": "So, that's what I meant when I said",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.66,
          "end": 212.49,
          "en": "that GitHub Copilot uses your code as context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.49,
          "end": 215.73,
          "en": "At least at the moment, it does not seem to scan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.73,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "all the code files automatically behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 222.87,
          "en": "Instead, it uses the code it saw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 226.02,
          "en": "And it's not just using the code it saw in one single file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.02,
          "end": 229.44,
          "en": "but instead, as you just saw here in this example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.44,
          "end": 232.92000000000002,
          "en": "it basically picked up the code in this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.92000000000002,
          "end": 237.57,
          "en": "and understood that it's this CoreConcept component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.57,
          "end": 239.79,
          "en": "that's in the end being used here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.79,
          "end": 243.78,
          "en": "and based on that, it was then able to make a suggestion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.78,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "regarding this image prop that should be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "And therefore, by working like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 252.33,
          "en": "GitHub Copilot can of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.33,
          "end": 254.61,
          "en": "generate pretty smart suggestions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.61,
          "end": 257.253,
          "en": "and therefore speed up your development flow.",
          "zh": ""
        }
